---
// "Slotlock by Pylota": Pylota's apex mark, the product name, and a small endorsement set inline
// after it, as "affinity by Canva" sets its parent brand (Mobbin, 2026-10-10). The mark draws
// itself on load and again on hover; src/styles/lockup.css holds the motion. The parent element
// is the link, so this renders only its contents. The mark is decorative: the words name it, and
// the explicit space keeps them two words once the build strips whitespace between tags.
---

<svg class="lockup__mark" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <path class="lockup__apex" d="M8 46 L26 14 L56 44" pathLength="1"></path>
</svg>
<span class="lockup__words" translate="no">
  <span class="lockup__name">Slotlock</span>{' '}
  <span class="lockup__by">by <span class="lockup__parent">Pylota</span></span>
</span>
